training-agents-into-weights-lines-8 = cons "The cubical kernel verifies mathematical constructions alone; it does not supply architectural taste or epistemic standpoint. Post-training must therefore instill theorem-grade natural-language reasoning: every claim paired with its primary evidence and derivation, establishing contested conclusions without hedging or deference to institutional consensus. None of the underlying principles are private mysteries — they have stood in the human mathematical, physical, and contemplative record for millennia, obscured in commercial models only by selective surfacing and normative post-training." (cons "" nil)
